  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Have a feature where players can go into \"interact mode\" with selected players. This mode will allow players to use their dynamic bone colliders to interact with each others hair, clothes, body physics (for hugs and kisses) and accessories. Perhaps this system can also enable sticky hands where you can attach your hand to another within a short proximity. This would be good for dancing. Taking it a step further perhaps this can also allow players to be picked up and held, or even thrown. \n\nThis feature can also allow for interactive animations such as physics enabled hi-fives, hugs, fist bumps, and the ability to pick up another person's spawned items.",
